ndon to drive rapid growth across various industries for our revolutionary online payment solution.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you are a driven and focused salesperson with a proven track record of selling cutting edge payment solutions in a high-growth and competitive environment, this is the role for you. In return, on top of a tremendous working environment, we offer you an unrivalled uncapped recurring commissions plan.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reporting to the Director, the Senior Sales Manager will handle multiple sales cycles, always ensuring a high conversion rate and outperforming the sales targets.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Along the way, you'll collaborate closely with various in-house talents across Technology and Business to position our capabilities, products, services and solutions effectively with prospects. The ideal candidate will need to be an independent, high-achieving individual, able to stand out in an entrepreneurial environment and outperform sales targets through personal drive.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong><u>How you’ll make an impact</u></strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify the most promising merchants and prospects and grow a healthy pipeline across various verticals</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sell our new cross-borders payment solutions and services to eCommerce merchants through outbound and inbound techniques</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help new merchants evaluate<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://checkout.com/"><u> </u></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Checkout.com"><u>Checkout.com</u></a> and handle detailed questions about our product capabilities, serving as a consultant and industry expert</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prepare thorough presentations and proposals for prospective merchants</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Orchestrate the entire Sales