<li id="p-rc_1c248426204c0254-31" data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="8,0,0,0">Drive end-to-end fraud management and detection strategies across all product types and payment flows</span><span data-path-to-node="8,0,0,2">.</span></li>
<li id="p-rc_1c248426204c0254-32" data-path-to-node="8,1,0"><span data-path-to-node="8,1,0,0">Streamline customer support workflows to improve resolution speed, operational efficiency, and user trust</span><span data-path-to-node="8,1,0,2">.</span></li>
<li data-path-to-node="8,2,0">Oversee the operational maintenance and reliability of coupon auto-apply and app-to-app features.</li>
<li id="p-rc_1c248426204c0254-33" data-path-to-node="8,3,0"><span data-path-to-node="8,3,0,0">Partner with Finance to forecast and manage cash allocations and liquidity across provider accounts</span><span data-path-to-node="8,3,0,2">.</span></li>
