strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Monitor and explain our performance</strong> towards our business objectives</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Enable our Sales and Account Management teams</strong> to achieve these business objectives and become the most effective commercial teams in the tech industry (i.e., Sales and AM effectiveness, tools, analytics and training)</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Across all these areas we work very closely with the Senior Leadership, the Sales, Account Management and Go-to-Market teams. The <strong>scope is Global</strong> (France, Belgium, Spain and Canada for the time being).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>🎯 Your mission</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be owning medium to large scale/complexity projects (depending on your skills and experience) <strong>on the Business Planning and Strategy area. These would include:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Business Strategy</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work closely with senior business leaders</strong> (Business leads, Insurance Lead, Marketing lead, CFO, CEO, etc.) <strong>to define Alan’s business plan</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Frame business and resource allocation decisions</strong> (e.g. where to accelerate/slow down in terms of segments or products, where to deploy sales and marketing resources, how to optimize for short vs. long term, what are is the impact on metrics such as payback, LTV, CAC)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Propose adjustments to the plan</strong> on a quarterly basis and support Board preparation</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sales &amp; Account Manager Planning</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Translate the plan into actionable sales &amp; Account Management objectives</strong>, ensuring their quality, scalability and accuracy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build &amp; improve the infrastructure to </strong>track these targets (dashboard, models) hand in hand with the data team</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Performance monitoring &amp; Steering</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead or support strategic explorations</strong> (e.g. new segment, new distribution models) to frame strategic decisions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Monitor closely results and execution</strong> to gather learnings and adjust where necessary, sharing key learnings with the community and the company on a monthly basis</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work on transversal topics </strong>that allow us to gain insights &amp; better steer the team performance (competition analysis, implementation &amp; monitoring of pricing strategies, ...)</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul></li></ul><h1>🧐 Skills we are looking for</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We look above all for exceptional people motivated and committed in building one of the most effective Strategy and Planning team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>At least 3 years of experience within either:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Business strategy, sales strategy &amp; operations, revenue operations or business finance/ strategic finance departments in a B2B company (preferably)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Management consulting, investment banking or private equity</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Critical thinking and problem solving skills:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to deal effectively with ambiguity, bringing structure to ambiguous areas of opportunity</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.