irect wat ze opleveren. En er is volop ruimte om te groeien in je rol.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/nomios/marketing-specialist-cybersecurity-leiden-448956","tags":[],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Leiden, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1794239494},{"slug":"backend-engineer-payments-team-amsterdam-441218","company_name":"Fastned","title":"Backend Engineer - Payments Team","description":"<p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Join a fast-growing, listed company with a purpose! Fastned owns and operates a network of 400+ fast charging stations across 10 European countries, allowing electric vehicle drivers to charge their car with 100% green energy in just 15 minutes. Our goal is a European network of 1000 fast charging stations in prime locations, where all electric vehicles can charge with renewable energy from the sun and wind. We have recently been voted best charging network in the UK, France and the Netherlands. If you want to make a difference and work in an informal, international scale-up environment with future prospects, then read on!</span></strong></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#121317">Your role</span></strong></h3><p><span style="color:#000000">Fastned aims to accelerate the transition towards sustainable mobility by giving fast charging to electric drivers. Part of that mission is making car charging as simple as charging your phone, and paying for it should be just as effortless. As a Backend Engineer in the Payments team, you will help make paying for a charge frictionless, secure and reliable. Drivers can pay through the Fastned app, by QR code or with a contactless card at the charger.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">The team owns Fastned’s payments domain end to end. That covers integrations with payment service providers and payment terminals. It also covers the services behind payment methods, wallets, pre-authorisation and session payments, billing, invoicing and dunning. The stakes are high: Fastned handles 23,000+ charging sessions a day, and every one of those payments goes through our systems. We’re now moving towards real-time payments, where each session is paid instantly instead of invoiced later. As we are growing and adding roaming features as a Mobility Service Provider, there are many scale relevant challenges to solve.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">We have no legacy systems. You’ll work with Kotlin 2.x, Java 21+, and Spring Boot 4 on most services, AWS, Kubernetes, Kafka, SQL (Postgres), Terraform, GitLab CI/CD and REST APIs to build scalable, fault-tolerant services that drivers and our Finance team rely on every day. We encourage responsible AI usage and provide tooling like Claude Code, Codex, Dust</span><em><span style="color:#000000">.</span></em><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">You’ll work closely with the other product teams, alongside fellow Backend Engineers, Data, Design, an Engineering Manager and a Product Manager in a Scrum setup. This role suits an engineer who enjoys a complex domain, cares about getting the details right, and wants to grow by taking real ownership of business-critical systems.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#121317">Your overall responsibilities include</span></strong></h3><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Designing, developing, testing and reviewing reusable, maintainable and scalable code</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Working AI-first: using AI-augmented engineering, agentic workflows and AI tooling as a natural part of how you design, build, test and review, with judgement for where AI is a multiplier and where humans stay in the loop;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Taking ownership from discovery to post-production;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Taking operational responsibility for what you build, including monitoring, alerting and incident analysis;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Helping improve engineering methodologies and best practices</span></p></li></ul> <br> <h3><strong><span style="color:#000000">Who we are looking for</span></strong></h3><p><span style="color:#000000">In order to be successful in this role, you bring a strong sense of ownership and a pragmatic, proactive mindset. You enjoy working in a collaborative scale-up environment where things can change quickly and where taking initiative matters.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Additionally, you tick the following boxes:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have 3+ years of professional backend experience, with strong hands-on Kotlin and/or Java experience.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You have previous experience in the payments domain.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You have experience working in agile teams within an international, multicultural environment.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have experience building and operating microservices in production, using REST APIs, cloud platforms and relational databases.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You are familiar with event-driven architectures and technologies such as Kafka.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You care about reliability, maintainability and the operational impact of the software you build.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You spot opportunities and problems and pick them up yourself instead of waiting for a ticket.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You use AI tooling as part of your engineering workflow, with sound engineering judgement.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You are fluent in English and have an affinity with Fastned’s mission.</span></p></li></ul><h3><strong><span style="color:#000000">Nice to have</span></strong></h3><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Experience in e-mobility, energy, charging infrastructure or another operationally complex domain.</span></p></li></ul><h3><strong><span style="color:#000000">Join us in building a better future</span></strong></h3><p class="p1"><span style="color:#121317">We work hard to change the world, but we don't forget to recognise &amp; celebrate our successes, big and small. We focus on work-life balance, provide genuine work flexibility, and have family-friendly policies in place. </span></p><p class="p1"><span style="color:#121317">Electric mobility is new territory for you? Don’t worry! </span></p><p class="p1"><span style="color:#121317">As part of your onboarding, you will participate in a series of exciting workshops where you will learn everything about our industry and fast-charging infrastructure. </span></p><p class="p1"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Our benefits package includes:</span></strong></p><ul class="ul1"><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Stock option plan - we believe in shared value creation.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Pension plan (fully covered by Fastned).</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">A training and development budget of €3,000 per year per employee, because development and training are important to us and our sector offers endless opportunities.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">In order to experience and enjoy the EV life, you get access to our fully electric vehicle fleet (all charging expenses covered), which is also for private use.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">29 holidays. Additionally, we give you two mission days you can use to contribute to Fastned’s mission or to support a cause that is important to you.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Going the extra mile 